     "type": "note",
     "label": "Why equals and not ==",
     "html": "For objects, <code>==</code> asks \"are these the same object in memory?\". <code>equals</code> asks \"do these strings contain the same characters?\". Two separate <code>String</code> objects can hold the same text, so always compare strings with <code>equals</code>."
