       "public class CheckContact {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        WorkContact w = new WorkContact(\"Lee\", \"555-0199\", \"Globex\");\n        System.out.println(w.card());\n        System.out.println(w.getPhone());\n    }\n}\n"
