     "goal": "Write <code>Box&lt;T&gt;</code> with a private <code>T item</code>, <code>put(T)</code>, <code>get()</code>, <code>isEmpty()</code>, and <code>take()</code>, which returns the item and leaves the box empty.",
     "requirements": [],
