       "TopTwo.java",
       "public class TopTwo {\n    public static void addTopTwo(StackADT<Integer> s) {\n        int first = s.pop();\n        int second = s.pop();\n        s.push(first + second);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        StackADT<Integer> s = new ArrayStack<>();\n        s.push(6);\n        s.push(2);\n        s.push(5);\n        addTopTwo(s);\n        System.out.println(s);\n    }\n}\n"
