     "goal": "To write a number in binary, divide by 2 repeatedly: the remainders, read from last to first, are the binary digits. Write <code>Binary</code> with <code>public static String toBinary(int n)</code> for <code>n &gt;= 0</code>: push each <code>n % 2</code> onto a <code>Deque&lt;Integer&gt;</code> while dividing <code>n</code> by 2, then pop them into a string. <code>0</code> gives <code>&quot;0&quot;</code>. <code>main</code> prints <code>toBinary</code> of 6, 13 and 0.",
